</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 468pt;"><a id="ny20064721x2_def14a_103-toc_pg1"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 468pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 6.75pt; text-align: center;">TABLE OF CONTENTS </div><a id="TOC"><!--Anchor--></a><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="margin-top: 4pt; width: 468pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 444pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 4.22pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 4.22pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 15.55pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 444pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tSNR">SPECIAL NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS</a></div></td><td style="width: 4.22pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.22pt; background-color: #CCEEFF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 15.55pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF; white-space: nowrap