 group</div></td><td style="width: 11.04pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 11.04pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 61.91pt; padding-top: 0.01pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 10.95pt; text-align: left;">2,583,380</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 384pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 11.04pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 11.04pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 61.91pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">55<br/></div></div></div><div>
