</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 468pt;"><a id="ny20064721x2_def14a_118-prop5_pg9"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 468pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 6.75pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Effectiveness of the Second Amended 2023 Plan </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">If approved by our stockholders, the Second Amended 2023 Plan will become effective as of the date of the Annual&#160;Meeting. </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">If our stockholders do not approve the Second Amended 2023 Plan, it will not become effective and the Amended&#160;2023 Plan will continue in its current form. </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">The Board retains the discretion to abandon, and not implement, the Second Amended 2023 Plan at any time before it becomes effective. </div><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20.5pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Vote Required for the Approval of the Second Amended 2023 Plan </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Approval of the Second Amended 2023 Plan requires the affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast on the matter at the Annual Meeting. Abstentions and broker non-votes will have no effect on this proposal.</div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8.5pt; text-align: center;">THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS A VOTE &#8220;FOR&#8221; <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: justify;">APPROVAL OF A SECOND AMENDMENT AND RESTATEMENT OF THE 2023 EQUITY INCENTIVE </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">PLAN</div></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">56<br/></div></div></div><div>
</div><!--End Page 61--><div>
</div><div class="BRPFPageBreakArea" style="clear: both; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;"><div class="BRPFPageBreak" style="page-break-after: always;"><hr style="border-width: 0px; clear: both; margin: 4px auto; width: 612pt; height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000;"/></div></div><div>
</div><!--Begin Page 62--><div>
</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 468pt;"><a id="ny20064721x2_def14a_119-prop6_pg1"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 468pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 6.75pt; text-align: center;"><a id="tPROP6"><!--Anchor--></a>PROPOSAL SIX<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">APPROVAL OF THE CEO STRATEGIC AWARDS </div><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 13pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Overview </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">The Board is requesting stockholder approval of the grant of a time-based RSU award and performance-based RSU award to Ryan Steelberg, our President, Chief Executive Officer and Chairman of the Board. Such awards are referred to in this proxy statement as the &#8220;CEO Time-Based Award&#8221; and the &#8220;CEO Performance Award,&#8221; respectively, and collectively referred to as the &#8220;CEO Strategic Awards&#8221;. </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">On May&#160;11, 2026, our Compensation Committee and the disinterested members of our Board each approved the grant of the CEO Strategic Awards to Mr.&#160;Steelberg under our Amended 2023 Plan, subject to stockholder approval of both (1) the CEO Strategic Awards and (2) the Second Amended 2023 Plan (See Proposal 5 above for more information on the requested stockholder approval of the Second Amended 2023 Plan). If both of such stockholder approvals are not obtained at the Annual Meeting, the grant of the CEO Strategic Awards will not become effective and will be of no further force or effect. </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">The background and process, rationale and the material terms of the CEO Strategic Awards are summarized below. </div><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Background and Process </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">Our Compensation Committee, in consultation with our compensation consultant, Compensia, designed the CEO Strategic Awards following extensive discussions. The CEO Strategic Awards&#8217; primary objective is to ensure that our Chief Executive Officer is appropriately incentivized to navigate current challenging global market conditions, drive the Company&#8217;s business forward with a growth mindset and further align our Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s interest with the interests of the Company&#8217;s stockholders. </div><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Rationale </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify;">After engaging in a rigorous deliberative process over a period of four months and arriving at the terms for the CEO Strategic Awards, the Compensation Committee approved such awards and now recommends that our stockholders approve the CEO Strategic Awards for the following three primary reasons: </div><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 20pt; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#8226;</div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">The CEO Strategic Awards significantly strengthen Mr.&#160;Steelberg&#8217;s incentives and further align his interests with those of the Company&#8217;s other stockholders; </div></td></tr></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 20pt; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#8226;</div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">The CEO Strategic Awards help ensure Mr.&#160;Steelberg&#8217;s continued leadership of the Company over the long term and provide him with significant challenges necessary to engage him for the long term; and </div></td></tr></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 20pt; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#8226;</div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">The CEO Strategic Awards contain challenging and rigorous performance hurdles (as described below) and require the creation of significant stockholder value to be earned. </div></td></tr></table><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Description of the CEO Strategic Awards </div><div class="BRDSX_para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: left;">The material features of the CEO Strategic Awards are described below. </div><div class="BRDSX_h4" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 20pt; text-align: left;">CEO Performance Award </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 7pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_txttab" style="width: 468pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 96pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="height: 6pt; width: 360pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_header"><td style="width: 96pt; padding-bottom: 2.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Award Terms</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: none;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; border-bottom: none;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-bottom: 2.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Details </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 2.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Effective Grant Date</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 2.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">July&#160;7, 2026 (which is the date of the Annual Meeting) </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Award Type</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Performance-based RSU award </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Number of Shares Subject to Award</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">925,000 shares of our common stock, representing approximately 1% of the total outstanding shares of our common stock as of March&#160;31, 2026. </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 96pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Performance Years:</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="width: 360pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8220;Performance Year 1&#8221;: July&#160;7, 2026 through July&#160;7, 2027<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8220;Performance Year 2&#8221;: July&#160;7, 2027 through July&#160;7, 2028<br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8220;Performance Year 3&#8221;: July&#160;7, 2028 through July&#160;7, 2029 <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Performance Year 1, Performance Year 2 and Performance Year 3 are each sometimes referred to as a &#8220;Performance Year&#8221; and collectively referred to as the &#8220;Performance Years&#8221;.</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 96pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="height: 2.75pt; width: 360pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">57<br/></div></div></div><div>
</div><!--End Page 62--><div>
